<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">28062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Twin earthquakes have killed one thousand four hundred thirty people across Venezuela, and rescue teams say only hours remain to find anyone still alive beneath the rubble.</s> <s>More than three thousand two hundred others are injured, and families have gathered outside a Caracas hospital, waiting for names that may never be called.</s> <s>Whether the search turns from rescue to recovery before nightfall is the question no official wants to answer.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A ninety-minute gun battle tore through Karachi, Pakistan's largest city, leaving four Sindh Rangers dead and six attackers killed.</s> <s>The fighters belonged to Jamaat-ul-Ahrar, a faction of the banned Pakistani Taliban, and they struck far from its northwestern strongholds — a sign the insurgency is no longer contained to the frontier provinces where it was born.</s> <s>One wounded attacker was captured alive, and what he reveals may show just how deep that network now reaches into the south.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States Supreme Court has cleared the way to strip Temporary Protected Status from Haitians and Syrians, two peoples fleeing state collapse and war.</s> <s>That status was the legal firewall against deportation, and the court held the executive may now lift it for entire nationalities at once, with no individual review of who gets sent back.</s> <s>Who a state chooses to protect, or to expel, is the truest measure of its values — and this ruling sets a precedent for every protected group that follows.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Across South Africa, an anti-immigrant movement has called a nationwide shutdown for the thirtieth of June.</s> <s>Its organizers trace back to former president Jacob Zuma's family networks, and his uMkhonto we Sizwe party has endorsed the action — the same organizational roots behind the twenty twenty-one unrest that killed more than three hundred people.</s> <s>Security forces insist they're better prepared this time, though whether economic desperation can be turned into mass mobilization remains uncertain.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Turkey has unveiled Yıldırımhan, its first intercontinental ballistic missile program, claiming a range of three thousand seven hundred miles.</s> <s>Ankara frames it as strategic autonomy, the same logic now driving rearmament from Japan to Poland as confidence in old security guarantees quietly erodes.</s> <s>The range claim is unproven, so for now it signals intent more than capability — a rising Muslim-world power telling everyone it means to stand on its own.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American and Iranian forces have traded fire across the Strait of Hormuz, shattering a fragile ceasefire.</s> <s>Drones struck a cargo ship outside Iran's approved shipping lane, the United States answered with airstrikes, and Tehran hit American bases hours later.</s> <s>Iran's Revolutionary Guard has warned that any repeat will draw a harsher response, leaving the world's most vital oil corridor one miscalculation from closure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Serbia's president, Aleksandar Vučić, has vowed to resign within weeks, ending thirteen years in power.</s> <s>His pledge follows months of student-led protests ignited by a fatal railway station collapse, a rare case of a populist strongman pushed toward the exit by the street rather than the ballot box.</s> <s>He's named no date for dissolving parliament — and within weeks may yet prove a way to wait the anger out.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In India, Congress leader Sonia Gandhi has charged that New Delhi's silence on Gaza has cost it global standing.</s> <s>She noted that India stayed quiet as Western states recognized Palestine and a United Nations commission found Israeli actions amount to genocide.</s> <s>Pakistan, she warned, is now filling the role India once played across West Asia — a striking admission of influence surrendered.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Nigeria has promised to finish a twenty-eight kilometre stretch of its coastal highway this year, near Ogun Waterside.</s> <s>That road is one link in the seven hundred kilometre Lagos-Calabar Coastal Highway, meant to give a planned deep-sea port its first direct access to the shoreline instead of a route thirty-five kilometres inland.</s> <s>No contractor milestone has been set, and Nigeria's long record of unfinished megaprojects makes this a promise worth watching.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Drone fragments have set fire to an oil refinery in Slavyansk-on-Kuban, in Russia's Krasnodar region.</s> <s>It's the latest hit in Ukraine's methodical campaign against the refining capacity that funds Moscow's war, with energy infrastructure now the real front line rather than any trench.</s> <s>The plant reported no casualties, yet each strike tightens domestic fuel supply and chips away at the export revenue keeping the war running.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United Arab Emirates will let Iranian airlines resume direct flights on the first of July, as war-delayed cargo finally begins clearing at Jebel Ali port.</s> <s>For Iran's sanctioned economy, Dubai's re-export trade is a lifeline that survives even open conflict, because both sides quietly need it.</s> <s>Trade is recovering toward pre-war levels only gradually — proof that Gulf interdependence often outlasts the headlines of war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gold, silver, and bitcoin are now selling off together, all unwinding the same bet against paper money.</s> <s>Analysts say capital is rotating out of that debasement trade and into artificial intelligence shares, with bitcoin down roughly half from its peak.</s> <s>The rally in machine intelligence shows no sign of slowing, leaving the old hedges against currency decline suddenly out of favour.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A study across four baboon populations finds that females with stronger family bonds simply live longer.</s> <s>Social structure, not diet alone, explains how the species thrives from the edge of the Sahara to tropical forests and into the Arabian Peninsula.</s> <s>Behavioral ecology keeps arriving at the same lesson — that kinship and cooperation are survival infrastructure, far beyond primates.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Germany has set a national temperature record of forty-one point three degrees Celsius as a brutal heatwave grips Europe.</s> <s>Denmark also broke its all-time high, and scientists say the event would have been virtually impossible without human-caused climate change.</s> <s>France has counted dozens of deaths, a reminder that a warming world charges its first costs to the most vulnerable.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A compound found in green tea has reduced stroke damage in laboratory rats.</s> <s>It steers the brain's immune cells toward repair through the Nrf2 pathway, cutting the secondary inflammation that kills neurons after blood flow returns.</s> <s>The mechanism worked in rodents, and that's the catch — promising pathways in animals rarely survive intact all the way to the clinic.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Mathematicians have upgraded the famed Erdős probabilistic method, eighty years after its invention.</s> <s>The technique proves that complex structures must exist by using pure randomness, and it quietly underpins error-correcting codes, algorithm design, and the theory of networks.</s> <s>This improvement ripples outward across the tools that shape modern computing — a reminder that an old idea can still gain fresh power.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers have given a large language model a structured spatial memory, modeled on how animals store landmarks, routes, and survey maps.</s> <s>Navigation success in robots rose from seventeen point six percent to nearly forty-five percent — still failing more often than it succeeds.</s> <s>That gap shows how far machines remain from the effortless wayfinding a child, or even an ant, takes for granted.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>